      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Davenport%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Putnam Museum, founded in 1867, was one of the first museums west of the Mississippi River.",
