      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Davenport%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every year, Davenport hosts the Bix Beiderbecke Jazz Festival, celebrating the legendary trumpeter who inspired the event.",
